            "review_text": "Kyle\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nA wonderful pub with live music for weekend\nSep 2016 • Couples\nA wonderful pub!!! This pub always has live music at every night. All the bands play here are the city famous bands. They play almost the newest song of Viet Nam and US-UK. They have 3 type of drink: wine, cocktails and beer they also have food. This pub is not big so you have to book before come, as my experience you should ask them to repeat your name after book cause they always forget to take note your booking. Anyway, it is a good pub for couples at the weekend or to celebrate a special event with a group of friends.\nRead more\nWritten September 17, 2016",
