            "review_text": "JHXT\nLondon, United Kingdom9 contributions\n0\nPerfect place for a friendly get-together\nFeb 2015 • Friends\nA group of friends and I spent a couple of hours at the bar at the end of the Tet festival and what a great time we had.\n\nThere is a large selection of savoury snacks for those peckish and main courses if one decides to have a full meal. We ordered several snack dishes. The food arrived not too long after the beers and was cooked to an acceptable standard. Our favourite dishes must have been the crispy fried chicken gristle and buffalo jerky.\n\nThe live music was a mix of Vietnamese and popular English songs. Both of the bands played that night (Fang band & singers and l.a.v.a band) were fantastic.\n\nIt's a perfect hangout for those who would like to check out the local pop music scene while enjoying a cold glass of beer.\nRead more\nWritten February 27, 2015",
